// googleDriveOAuthToken.json is auto-generated on the first successful OAuth login.
// It is listed in .gitignore and must never be committed.
//
// The token file is written to:
//   tests/browserstack_automation/config/googleDriveOAuthToken.json
//
// Expected shape of the generated JSON:
//
// {
//   "access_token":  "<short-lived access token>",
//   "refresh_token": "<long-lived refresh token, present only on first issue>",
//   "scope":         "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive",
//   "token_type":    "Bearer",
//   "expiry_date":   1234567890000
// }
//
// You do not need to create this file manually.
// Run either utility once and complete the browser prompt to populate it.